%% Frontend and admin data flow (proposed; same collections)
sequenceDiagram
  participant R as Reader browser
  participant S as Express server
  participant F as Firestore
  participant E as Editor browser (admin)
  participant G as Gemini
  R->>S: GET /article/{id}
  S->>F: REST read article (published only)
  S-->>R: index.html with per-URL head + JSON-LD
  R->>F: read settings + published articles (status == "published")
  E->>F: Google sign-in → read users/{uid}.role
  E->>F: write articles/{id} (draft / pending_review)
  E->>S: POST /api/ai/* with Bearer ID token
  S->>S: verify token, requireRole(reporter+)
  S->>G: generate
  S-->>E: AI draft (labelled)
  E->>F: Editor sets status published (rules check role)
  S->>F: sitemaps read published articles
